      "id": "ip1",
      "text": {
        "en": "Founded in 2003, OWELL Industrial (Jiujiang Ouwei Industrial Co.LTD) has grown into a leading manufacturer of LED sensor lights and security lighting solutions. Our 40,000㎡ state-of-the-art factory in Jiujiang combines advanced production technology with rigorous quality control.",
        "zh": "",
        "es": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ip2",
      "text": {
        "en": "We specialize in PIR motion sensor lights, solar LED lights, and commercial lighting products, serving clients in over 50 countries. Our commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction has earned us long-term partnerships with leading brands worldwide.",
        "zh": "",
        "es": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "order": 2
    }
